1
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:28,260
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:31,500
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:34,100
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:37,700
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:37,940 --> 00:00:40,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:43,100
♪Calm but full of pearls♪

7
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:46,060
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:49,420
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:00:52,980 --> 00:00:53,570
=Quite The Girl=

10
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:54,110
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

11
00:00:54,110 --> 00:00:54,620
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

12
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:55,940
=Episode 20=

13
00:00:55,980 --> 00:00:57,260
(809)

14
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,720
(With this aphrodisiac diffuser...)

15
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:19,440
(Lu Mingyu, let's see
how you get out of this.)

16
00:01:24,820 --> 00:01:27,780
(809)

17
00:01:31,080 --> 00:01:32,760
I'll bring you the key card.

18
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,200
Once Qin Lian comes in,

19
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,600
bring the reporters up.

20
00:01:35,760 --> 00:01:36,520
Remember,

21
00:01:36,640 --> 00:01:38,120
I want the juiciest shots.

22
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,600
Post them right away.

23
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:43,360
(Flirting with Duan Xiuming...)

24
00:01:43,360 --> 00:01:45,880
(while sneaking around with Qin Lian.)

25
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:48,280
(No matter how much you try to deny it,)

26
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:49,240
(no one will believe you.)

27
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:52,920
(I'll be next door enjoying the show.)

28
00:01:54,160 --> 00:01:55,600
(Hurry!)

29
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,120
(This way!)

30
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:59,080
(Get more shots!)

31
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:09,400
Mr. Duan.

32
00:02:09,440 --> 00:02:09,760
Mr. Duan.

33
00:02:09,880 --> 00:02:10,720
Why are you here?

34
00:02:10,760 --> 00:02:12,840
You media folks sure are eager.

35
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:15,360
My wife and I finally
got away for a vacation.

36
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:17,040
And you just couldn't wait

37
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,440
to barge into our room?

38
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:20,200
Trying to get shots of us

39
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:21,920
for a bedroom headline?

40
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,080
Go on.

41
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:25,920
Aim the camera.

42
00:02:26,520 --> 00:02:27,200
Get some good shots.

43
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,040
Make sure my wife looks good.

44
00:02:29,080 --> 00:02:30,240
Because your photos,

45
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,280
along with your media outlet's name,

46
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:34,880
will soon be on my lawyer's desk.

47
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:37,320
Breaking and entering.
Invasion of privacy.

48
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,840
We'll settle them one by one.

49
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:40,520
Mr. Duan.

50
00:02:40,520 --> 00:02:41,920
Is your marriage to Miss Lu

51
00:02:41,920 --> 00:02:43,000
just for show?

52
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:48,640
(Holder: Duan Xiuming)
Here.

53
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:49,840
Take a good look.

54
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:52,280
Want me to read it to you?

55
00:02:52,280 --> 00:02:54,280
(Holder: Duan Xiuming)
Or should I call the registry

56
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,280
(Duan Xiuming, Lu Mingye)
and hold you a press conference?

57
00:02:56,900 --> 00:02:57,940
(Marriage Certificate)

58
00:02:58,020 --> 00:02:59,300
(Holder: Duan Xiuming
Date: Aug. 20th, 2026)

59
00:03:01,320 --> 00:03:02,080
Lu Mingye.

60
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,520
Dare to go all in?

61
00:03:07,680 --> 00:03:09,160
Marriage Agreement?

62
00:03:09,400 --> 00:03:11,480
(Marriage Agreement)
Mutually beneficial cooperation.

63
00:03:11,520 --> 00:03:12,520
Being Mrs. Duan

64
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,120
will be your strongest shield.

65
00:03:14,240 --> 00:03:16,240
It frees you from the Qins,

66
00:03:16,240 --> 00:03:17,880
and helps you reclaim all you want.

67
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:19,080
Then you can focus

68
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,320
on serving Dongchen.

69
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,880
This deal lasts three months.

70
00:03:23,120 --> 00:03:24,520
After three months,

71
00:03:24,640 --> 00:03:25,760
our marriage

72
00:03:25,880 --> 00:03:27,760
can be ended by mutual consent.

73
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,760
Are you willing to do that?

74
00:03:39,760 --> 00:03:40,520
I am.

75
00:03:43,980 --> 00:03:46,220
(Lu Mingye)

76
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:49,880
Honey.

77
00:03:50,120 --> 00:03:51,160
Let's switch hotels.

78
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,040
Don't let these nobodies

79
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:54,080
ruin our mood.

80
00:03:54,800 --> 00:03:55,600
Okay.

81
00:03:59,680 --> 00:04:00,680
How thrilling.

82
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:02,080
You want headlines?

83
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:03,960
I think it's next door.

84
00:04:03,960 --> 00:04:05,160
(Come on, let's go!)

85
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,480
(Quick, this way!)

86
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,320
(Follow me! Here!)

87
00:04:09,520 --> 00:04:09,720
(Quick!)

88
00:04:11,240 --> 00:04:11,720
(More shots!)

89
00:04:13,340 --> 00:04:15,360
♪Gentle smile never tells my fight♪

90
00:04:15,360 --> 00:04:16,520
Who let you in?

91
00:04:16,760 --> 00:04:18,480
Get out!

92
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:20,040
Get out!

93
00:04:20,040 --> 00:04:21,080
Who let you in?

94
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:21,720
Stop!

95
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:22,360
Get out!

96
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:23,600
Stop!

97
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:26,120
Quite a show.

98
00:04:26,960 --> 00:04:28,080
Dear reporters,

99
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,680
my wife had nothing to do with this.

100
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,040
Anyone who spreads rumors

101
00:04:33,320 --> 00:04:34,800
or throws mud at her

102
00:04:34,920 --> 00:04:36,400
will make an enemy

103
00:04:36,400 --> 00:04:38,040
of Dongchen and me.

104
00:04:38,740 --> 00:04:40,240
♪Don't beg for mercy,
don't bow down freely♪

105
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:40,960
One more thing.

106
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:42,360
Our marriage

107
00:04:42,360 --> 00:04:43,760
is staying private.

108
00:04:44,720 --> 00:04:45,760
You know what to do.

109
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:47,080
I don't need to spell it out, do I?

110
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:47,880
Got it.

111
00:04:47,920 --> 00:04:48,360
Got it.

112
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,920
A headline like this

113
00:04:49,920 --> 00:04:50,880
doesn't come every day.

114
00:04:51,620 --> 00:04:53,780
♪Power hidden underneath♪

115
00:04:53,920 --> 00:04:54,440
(More shots!)

116
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:55,880
Have fun.

117
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,680
Duan Xiuming!

118
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,520
Lu Mingyu!

119
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,800
- Get back here!
- You witch!

120
00:05:04,200 --> 00:05:04,880
Xiuming.

121
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:06,160
(8:00 AM)
Our men at the Qins

122
00:05:06,160 --> 00:05:07,400
(8:00 AM)
just sent word.

123
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:08,320
They said,

124
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,320
Qin Lian is planning

125
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,080
to tamper with the lift

126
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,560
on your way to the site.

127
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,280
He finally made a move.

128
00:05:15,920 --> 00:05:16,720
Then...

129
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,560
Let's play along.

130
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,000
Get our people ready.

131
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:21,880
Once Qin Lian thinks he's won,

132
00:05:22,040 --> 00:05:23,280
get me out at once.

133
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:23,920
Understood.

134
00:05:24,160 --> 00:05:24,920
I'm on it.

135
00:05:26,540 --> 00:05:27,420
(8:00 AM)

136
00:05:27,420 --> 00:05:29,260
(10:01 AM; 809)

137
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:30,440
(Yue.)

138
00:05:30,560 --> 00:05:32,560
(Duan Xiuming's side is all set.)

139
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:33,880
(Now it's our turn.)

140
00:05:34,140 --> 00:05:35,640
(809)

141
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:36,680
(Pretend to be me)

142
00:05:36,760 --> 00:05:37,800
(and lure Lu Qian in.)

143
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:40,040
(806)
(Switch the diffuser to 806.)

144
00:05:46,300 --> 00:05:47,540
(806)

145
00:05:47,780 --> 00:05:48,460
(10:01 AM)

146
00:05:48,460 --> 00:05:49,500
(10:13 AM)

147
00:05:51,460 --> 00:05:52,560
(806)

148
00:05:52,560 --> 00:05:55,240
(Swap room signs after Lu Qian returns.)

149
00:05:56,700 --> 00:05:59,380
(806; 809)

150
00:06:01,620 --> 00:06:03,580
(809)

151
00:06:04,420 --> 00:06:05,380
(10:01 AM)

152
00:06:05,380 --> 00:06:06,240
(10:25 AM)

153
00:06:06,240 --> 00:06:07,840
(Wait for Qin Lian to walk in.)

154
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:10,680
(Mission complete.)
(Wretches, you two deserve each other.)

155
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:27,920
Uncle, Auntie.

156
00:06:36,520 --> 00:06:37,880
What's all this about?

157
00:06:42,320 --> 00:06:43,760
I'm here to apologize.

158
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:45,320
Marrying Mingyu without telling you

159
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,800
was my fault.

160
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:48,680
We did marry in a hurry,

161
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,680
but traditions still matter.

162
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,000
Here's the betrothal gift.

163
00:06:56,860 --> 00:06:57,900
(Romantic)

164
00:07:00,880 --> 00:07:02,120
Look at you two.

165
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:03,680
Such a perfect match.

166
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:05,560
Since we're family now,

167
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:09,040
Lu Qian's legal notice, can you...

168
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,120
Speaking of which, I should thank her.

169
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:13,840
I always wanted to marry Mingyu.

170
00:07:14,560 --> 00:07:15,680
If not for Lu Qian,

171
00:07:15,960 --> 00:07:17,520
I wouldn't be her husband so soon.

172
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,320
She's such a good cousin.

173
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:22,560
How could I

174
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:23,960
ever sue her?

175
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,120
Right.

176
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:26,240
Exactly.

177
00:07:26,440 --> 00:07:28,840
Suing family is so unnecessary.

178
00:07:28,840 --> 00:07:30,680
Xiuming, you rarely visit.

179
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:31,600
What would you like?

180
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,320
I'll have the kitchen prepare it.

181
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:35,240
Wait, Auntie.

182
00:07:44,680 --> 00:07:47,000
Family dinners need everyone.

183
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:50,560
Shouldn't we bring Grandma back?

184
00:07:53,440 --> 00:07:55,680
This card is for Grandma, too.

185
00:08:04,120 --> 00:08:04,720
Sure.

186
00:08:05,320 --> 00:08:06,760
I'll go get Mom.

187
00:08:12,440 --> 00:08:13,800
Come on, have a seat.

188
00:08:14,040 --> 00:08:14,800
Here, Mom.

189
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,200
Mom...

190
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:23,160
Remember I told you

191
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,680
a man wanted to marry Ye?

192
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,320
His family's decent,

193
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:30,000
but his reputation is awful.

194
00:08:30,120 --> 00:08:31,440
He loves every woman.

195
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,680
Heaven knows what he

196
00:08:32,680 --> 00:08:34,240
told Ye to win her over.

197
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:35,240
Those two

198
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:37,440
got married in secret.

199
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:39,520
That wretch.

200
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:43,920
Mom.

201
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,560
When we get home,

202
00:08:46,160 --> 00:08:48,040
you must teach him a lesson.

203
00:08:48,120 --> 00:08:49,440
Kick him out of the family.

204
00:08:51,360 --> 00:08:52,120
Grandma!

205
00:08:53,240 --> 00:08:54,040
Grandma...

206
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,880
Ye...

207
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,440
It's me, Ye.

208
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:59,120
I've missed you.

209
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,360
I missed you too.

210
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,240
Grandma.

211
00:09:04,120 --> 00:09:05,560
I want you to meet someone.

212
00:09:08,720 --> 00:09:09,840
This is Duan Xiuming.

213
00:09:09,920 --> 00:09:10,680
Grandma.

214
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:11,760
It's our first meeting.

215
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:12,920
Glad to meet you.

216
00:09:14,720 --> 00:09:15,360
Mom.

217
00:09:15,840 --> 00:09:18,320
This is the man I told you about
on the way here.

218
00:09:18,800 --> 00:09:20,520
The one Ye insists on marrying.

219
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:22,480
(This man...)

220
00:09:23,240 --> 00:09:24,600
(Loves every woman.)

221
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:26,720
(You must teach him a lesson.)

222
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:28,480
(Kick him out of the family.)

223
00:09:52,920 --> 00:09:53,680
Are you okay?

224
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:00,480
Ye...

225
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,360
Grandma.

226
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,520
You ran to protect him.

227
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:08,360
Now I understand

228
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,280
you truly love him.

229
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:15,720
My child...

230
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,840
You protected Ye.

231
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:20,720
I saw that, too.

232
00:10:21,480 --> 00:10:22,720
Bless you both.

233
00:10:41,240 --> 00:10:41,880
Mom.

234
00:10:43,480 --> 00:10:44,600
Ever since you left,

235
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:45,720
I've been

236
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:47,520
thinking about you every day.

237
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,480
I'm so glad you're home.

238
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:55,200
Such devotion, Auntie.

239
00:10:56,120 --> 00:10:57,360
Truly touching.

240
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,520
Then you won't mind

241
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:01,600
cleaning Grandma's room.

242
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:04,840
Mingyu.

243
00:11:05,280 --> 00:11:08,000
You and Grandma haven't met in so long.

244
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,520
So much to catch up on.

245
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,600
How about this?

246
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:12,360
Let Grandma stay with you.

247
00:11:12,480 --> 00:11:13,840
Then you two

248
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,200
can catch up properly.

249
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:16,200
No way.

250
00:11:17,840 --> 00:11:19,520
I can't leave my wife.

251
00:11:19,880 --> 00:11:21,400
I'm staying here tonight.

252
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,640
Without her beside me,

253
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,520
I can't sleep.

254
00:11:27,120 --> 00:11:28,200
Well, look.

255
00:11:28,280 --> 00:11:30,160
I didn't think this through.

256
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,880
You're newlyweds, after all.

257
00:11:31,880 --> 00:11:33,760
How could I separate you two?

258
00:11:33,880 --> 00:11:35,720
It's so nice of you
to be this understanding.

259
00:11:36,520 --> 00:11:37,600
We're so lucky.

260
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:39,760
Then we'll leave it to you.

261
00:11:40,820 --> 00:11:43,300
♪Gentle smile never tells my fight♪

262
00:11:43,300 --> 00:11:46,460
♪They think I'm weak, easy to control♪

263
00:11:46,540 --> 00:11:49,540
♪I keep my calm, hide all my soul♪

264
00:11:49,780 --> 00:11:51,780
♪Bite back tears, hold every pain♪

265
00:12:14,200 --> 00:12:19,350
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

266
00:12:21,270 --> 00:12:25,370
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

267
00:12:28,270 --> 00:12:33,050
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

268
00:12:33,990 --> 00:12:39,870
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

269
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:47,500
♪A love letter written in song♪

270
00:12:48,330 --> 00:12:53,820
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

271
00:12:55,660 --> 00:13:01,970
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

272
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:08,870
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

273
00:13:08,870 --> 00:13:12,270
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

274
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:15,990
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

275
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:19,080
♪Close your eyes and count♪

276
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:25,790
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

277
00:13:25,790 --> 00:13:28,090
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪
